### Health / ingestion status
GET http://localhost:5080/health

### Ask a first question (a new conversation is created)
POST http://localhost:5080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is a Copilot Credit?"
}

### Ask a follow-up (copy the conversationId from the previous response)
POST http://localhost:5080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "PASTE-ID-HERE",
  "message": "And how much does the pay-as-you-go meter cost per credit?"
}

### Show the stored history of a conversation
GET http://localhost:5080/api/conversations/PASTE-ID-HERE

### Delete a conversation
DELETE http://localhost:5080/api/conversations/PASTE-ID-HERE

### Re-run ingestion (force = delete and rebuild the Qdrant collection)
POST http://localhost:5080/api/ingest?force=true
